Papa Johns isn’t currently up for sale, but the company remains “open-minded” if the right offer were to come along. &nbsp;

Following reports that private equity firm, Apollo Global, had offered and then withdrew a $2.1 billion takeover bid of Papa Johns, CEO Todd Penegor indirectly addressed speculation during the Atlanta-based pizza chain’s third-quarter earnings call Thursday.&nbsp;

